    },
    "Claude Code shares plan usage only with its status line. To show it here, Purrdr will change ~/.claude/settings.json on this host as the user “%@”: the status line command becomes ~/.purrdr/claude-usage/statusline.sh, which saves the usage and then runs your current status line. Turning this off restores your original settings." : {
