    "Purrdr Plus belongs to your Purrdr member account. Sign in, and your purchase is added automatically." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr Plus 屬於你的 Purrdr 會員。登入後，你的購買項目會自動加入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr Plus · Active" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr Plus・已開通"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr adds a small herdr plugin to each host you turn on. When an agent needs you, the host tells Purrdr’s server, which notifies this device. Notifications show only the workspace name — never what the agent said. Notifications from Windows hosts are best-effort." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 會在你開啟的每台主機加裝一個小型 herdr plugin。Agent 需要你時，主機會告知 Purrdr 後台，再由後台通知這支裝置。通知只顯示 Workspace 名稱，絕不包含 Agent 說的內容。Windows 主機的通知為盡力傳送，不保證送達。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr can’t safely change ~/.claude/settings.json on this host." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 無法安全地修改這台主機的 ~/.claude/settings.json。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr can’t safely update the notes file on this host." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 無法安全地更新這台主機上的註記檔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr changes the Claude Code status line on %@ so it saves plan usage. You can turn it off and restore the original anytime." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 會修改 %@ 上 Claude Code 的 status line,讓它存下方案用量。隨時可以關閉並還原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr couldn’t read Codex’s answer. Updating Codex on the host may help." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 看不懂 Codex 的回應。更新主機上的 Codex 或許有幫助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr doesn’t open files in this location." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 不開啟這個位置的檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr host service %@ is available for %@. The host service updates itself automatically; to update now, run this on the host. Paired devices stay paired." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%2$@ 有新版的 Purrdr 主機服務 %1$@。主機服務會自動更新；要立刻更新，在主機上執行下面的指令。已配對的裝置不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr host service %@ is available for %@. This host runs %@, which can’t update itself: run the install command on the host once. From 0.5.0 on, the host service updates itself, or you can run purrdr-host-service update. Paired devices stay paired." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%2$@ 有新版的 Purrdr 主機服務 %1$@。這台主機目前是 %3$@,這個版本不能自己更新：請在主機上執行一次下面的安裝指令。0.5.0 起主機服務會自動更新，也可以執行 purrdr-host-service update。已配對的裝置不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr reads the theme in ~/.config/herdr/config.toml and adds a reference file at ~/.purrdr/theme/README.md as %@. It never changes your herdr settings. Turning this off removes the file." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 會以 %@ 讀取 ~/.config/herdr/config.toml 的主題，並新增參考檔 ~/.purrdr/theme/README.md。不會更動你的 herdr 設定;關閉後會移除這個檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr signs in to %@@%@ once with this password and adds this device’s public key to ~/.ssh/authorized_keys (administrators_authorized_keys for a Windows administrator). After that it signs in with the key. The password isn’t saved." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 會用這組密碼以 %@@%@ 登入一次，把這支裝置的公鑰加到 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys(Windows 的管理員是 administrators_authorized_keys),之後改用金鑰登入。密碼不會儲存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr supports macOS, Linux, and Windows hosts." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 支援 macOS、Linux 與 Windows 主機。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr tests the connection before saving the host." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 會先測試連線，再儲存主機。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr updates Claude Code’s notes file on this host when you act on a note. Undo puts back what Purrdr changed and asks again next time." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "對註記採取動作時，Purrdr 會更新這台主機上 Claude Code 的註記檔。復原會還原 Purrdr 改過的內容，下次會再詢問。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr will add ~/.local/bin/codex on this host as “%@”. It starts Codex with this pane’s herdr identity and changes nothing else. You can turn it off here at any time." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 會以「%@」在這台主機加入 ~/.local/bin/codex。它會帶著這個 Pane 的 herdr 身分啟動 Codex,不會更動其他東西。你隨時可以在這裡關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr will run “herdr plugin install” on this host as %@ and save a pairing key for this device in ~/.purrdr. Turning notifications off removes only this device’s pairing; the plugin is removed when the last device turns off." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 會以 %@ 身分在這台主機執行「herdr plugin install」,並在 ~/.purrdr 存這支裝置的配對密鑰。關閉通知只移除這支裝置的配對，最後一支裝置關閉時才移除外掛。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
