          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That message already left the queue. Refreshing the list." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "那則訊息已不在佇列裡,正在重新整理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That sign-in method belongs to another member with a subscription or synced hosts. Sign in with it, delete that member, then link it here." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這種登入方式屬於另一個有訂閱或主機同步資料的會員。請先用它登入、刪除那個會員，再回來連結。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That sign-in method had an empty member of its own. It was combined into this one." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這種登入方式原本有一個沒有資料的會員，已合併到目前的會員。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Agent Moved" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent 已換資料夾"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Demo host can’t start new chats. Add your own host to try this." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Demo 主機無法開始新對話。請新增你自己的主機再試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Demo host has sample conversations, so you can try every screen before you add a host." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Demo 主機有範例對話，新增主機前就能試用每個畫面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Purrdr host service on this host doesn’t match this version of Purrdr. Update Purrdr and the host service." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這台主機上的 Purrdr 主機服務與這個版本的 Purrdr 不相容。請更新 Purrdr 與主機服務。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Purrdr host service on this host is newer than this version of Purrdr. Update Purrdr." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這台主機上的 Purrdr 主機服務比這個版本的 Purrdr 新。請更新 Purrdr。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Purrdr host service on this host is older than this version of Purrdr. Update the host service on the host." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這台主機上的 Purrdr 主機服務比這個版本的 Purrdr 舊。請在主機上更新主機服務。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Purrdr plugin is already on this host. Purrdr will save a pairing key for this device in ~/.purrdr as %@. Turning notifications off removes only this device’s pairing." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這台主機已裝好 Purrdr 外掛。Purrdr 會以 %@ 身分在 ~/.purrdr 存這支裝置的配對密鑰。關閉通知只移除這支裝置的配對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Purrdr plugin is already on this host. The host service will save a pairing key for this device in ~/.purrdr. Turning notifications off removes only this device’s pairing." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這台主機已有 Purrdr 外掛。主機服務會在 ~/.purrdr 存入這支裝置的配對金鑰。關閉通知只會移除這支裝置的配對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Send When Done queue is full (20 messages). Wait for some to send or delete one." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「做完再送」佇列已滿(20 則)。等部分送出或刪除一則。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Tailscale sign-in wasn’t finished in time. Try again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "沒有及時完成 Tailscale 登入，請再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent didn’t pick up the message. It may be stuck on a prompt; check the terminal, then try again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent 沒有收到訊息，可能卡在某個提示上。請檢查終端機後再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent didn’t report its session, so its messages can’t be told apart from other chats in the same folder. Make sure the herdr integration for this agent is installed; it reports the session when one starts." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent 沒有回報 session,所以無法和同一個資料夾裡的其他對話區分。請確認已安裝這個 Agent 的 herdr 整合，它會在 session 開始時回報。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent hasn’t reported which session it’s in yet. Its messages appear here once it does." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent 還沒有回報它所在的 session。回報後訊息就會顯示在這裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent is no longer working in this folder. Go back and open the changes again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent 已不在這個資料夾工作，請返回後重新打開變更頁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent is waiting for an answer. Answer it first, then send." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent 正在等待回答，請先回答再送出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent is waiting for you." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent 正在等你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent is waiting for your answer, so this message wasn’t sent." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent 正在等你回答，所以這則訊息沒有送出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent is working. Its reply will appear here." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent 正在工作，回覆會顯示在這裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The answer may not have arrived. Check the agent, then try again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "回答可能沒有送達。請查看 Agent 後再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection dropped while sending. The message may have arrived; check the chat before sending again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
